REQUIRES Driver
REQUIRES Grid
REQUIRES physics/Hydro
REQUIRES physics/Gravity/GravityMain/Poisson
REQUIRES physics/sourceTerms/Burn/BurnMain
REQUIRES physics/Eos/EosMain/Helmholtz

USESETUPVARS withParticles

IF withParticles
   PARTICLETYPE passive INITMETHOD with_density MAPMETHOD weighted ADVMETHOD rungekutta
   REQUIRES Particles
   REQUIRES Particles/ParticlesInitialization/ParticlesOwned/WithDensity/CellMassBins
   REQUIRES Particles/ParticlesMapping/ParticlesOwned/meshWeighting/CIC
   REQUESTS IO/IOMain
   REQUESTS IO/IOParticles
ENDIF

#
# progenitor
#

PARAMETER     initialWDFile        STRING   "wd_profile_rhoc_332e5_M_100.dat"

#
# ambient medium outside star
#
# dens_fluff = density of the fluff
# temp_fluff = temperature of the fluff

D fluff_boundary_radius  fluff is ramped linearly in logDens and logTemp
D & between the surface of the progenitor star and this boundary radius.
D & Outside the boundary radius, fluff dens and temp are uniform
D dens_fluff_inner  fluff density just outside edge of star
D temp_fluff_inner  fluff temperature just outside edge of star
D dens_fluff_outer  fluff density in uniform outer region
D temp_fluff_outer  fluff temperature in uniform outer region
PARAMETER     fluff_boundary_radius    REAL     5e10
PARAMETER     dens_fluff_inner         REAL     1.0e-3
PARAMETER     temp_fluff_inner         REAL     3.0e7
PARAMETER     dens_fluff_outer         REAL     1.0e-9
PARAMETER     temp_fluff_outer         REAL     1.0e6

#
# ignition
#

PARAMETER     ignite             BOOLEAN  FALSE
PARAMETER     ign_x           REAL     0.e0
PARAMETER     ign_y           REAL     0.e0
PARAMETER     ign_z           REAL     0.e0
PARAMETER     ign_r           REAL     0.e0
PARAMETER     ign_temp_center REAL     1.e9
PARAMETER     ign_temp_edge   REAL     1.e8
PARAMETER     ign_keep_pres   BOOLEAN  FALSE
PARAMETER     ign_hemispherical  BOOLEAN  FALSE

PARAMETER     ign_file      BOOLEAN  FALSE
PARAMETER     ign_file_name STRING   "ignition_points.dat"


#
# custom refinement criteria
#

D refFluffThresh refinement threshold for derefinement in Fluff
D & above flff = this value, a maximum refinement level of refFluffLevel is enforced
D refFluffMargin     Padding margin for thresholding (in fractional units)
D refFluffLevel      Maximum refinement level of fluff

PARAMETER     refFluffThresh       REAL      0.99
PARAMETER     refFluffMargin       REAL      0.2
PARAMETER     refFluffLevel        INTEGER   1

PARAMETER     refNogenEnucThresh   REAL      1.e16
PARAMETER     refNogenMargin       REAL      0.5
PARAMETER     refNogenLevel        INTEGER   2

# settings for finding maximum radius of burned material

PARAMETER     refBurnedKeyProduct      STRING "ne20"
PARAMETER     refBurnedProductThresh   REAL   1.e-4

# settings for coarsening grid during ejecta phase

D refEjectaPhaseStartTime  simulation time after which a cell size minimum is
D & enforced based on the extent of the burned material on the grid (i.e. the
D & current physical size of the ejecta)
D refEjectaPhaseMinRes  maximum number of cells from origin out to edge
D & of burned material.  Burned material determined by key product specified
PARAMETER     refEjectaPhaseStartTime  REAL    1.0
PARAMETER     refEjectaPhaseMaxRes     INTEGER 256


PARTICLEPROP	dens		REAL
PARTICLEMAP	TO dens		FROM VARIABLE dens
PARTICLEPROP	temp		REAL
PARTICLEMAP	TO temp		FROM VARIABLE temp
PARTICLEPROP	pres		REAL
PARTICLEMAP	TO pres		FROM VARIABLE pres

DATAFILES wd_profile_rhoc_332e5_M_100.dat

# fluff marker
MASS_SCALAR flff


# override some unit defaults
PARAMETER useBurn BOOLEAN true
